      "Name": "ExtendedConversations.sideload_conversation.tooltip",
      "Commentary": "RT-ZH-ADD",
      "Localization": {
        "CULTURE_EN_US": "This will sideload a conversation into an already running conversation. Useful for having a top level conversation that loads others based on high level conditions. Important: Its recommeneded you set this action on Responses. If you set on a Prompt node then the following Response might not evaluate its condition but it will work for sideloading.",
        "CULTURE_ZH_CN": "这会把一段对话侧面加载进一个已在运行的对话中。适用于让一个顶层对话根据高层条件加载其他对话。重要：建议把此动作设置在\"回应\"节点上。如果你设置在\"提示\"节点上，后续的\"回应\"可能不会评估其条件，但侧面加载仍会生效。"
      }
    },
